* Reproduction, contsg group (stage B proofs). Generated by gen_repro.py - edit that file, not this one.
* Mirrors test/suite/mkrun.py's per-config block (seed 98765 / sortseed 98765 / ereturn clear / drops / use / preps.json lines).
* ARGUMENTS (positional, both required):
*   `1' repo    - the wooldid_dev checkout root (supplies test/data and test/suite/data)
*   `2' workdir - scratch directory holding old/ (the extracted build) and receiving old_dumps/
* EXACT INVOCATION (run from <workdir> so the log lands beside the dumps):
* PREREQUISITE: copy repro_helpers.doh (beside this file) into <workdir> first -
*   this do-file `include`s it from there. repro_run.sh does the copy for you.
*   cp <repro>/contsg/repro_helpers.doh <workdir>/
*   cd <workdir> && stata-mp -e do <repro>/contsg/repro_old.do <repo> <workdir>
args repo W_
local W "`W_'"
if "`repo'" == "" | "`W'" == "" {
  di as error "usage: do repro_old.do <repo-root> <workdir>"
  exit 198
}
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 20000
set graphics off
adopath ++ "`W'/old"
include "`W'/repro_helpers.doh"
dis "BUILD_DIR=`W'/old"
which wooldid
